{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":67063,"seasonNumber":5},"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":5,"name":{"value":"Stagione 5","language":"it-IT"},"year":2022,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5rHvzhXVJPvHIkke0nGXkZQbDDT.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"4094791","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"哪都通公司因廖忠之死，派遣六大区七名临时工调查碧游村。张楚岚作为陆北临时工，与冯宝宝一同参与行动。众人夜晚突袭碧游村，张楚岚以聊天为由拖住马仙洪，为破坏修身炉争取时间。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4qctiZxZFcanJnSuLtmZsQfYa5s.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4qctiZxZFcanJnSuLtmZsQfYa5s.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/1"},{"id":"4095906","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"肖自在找到碧游村上根器赵归真，赵归真修炼野茅山邪术杀害无辜，肖自在因瞧不起其行径，将他切碎。黑管与一名蒙古人战斗，此前他曾用马仙洪炼制的球控制童男童女，这对童男童女因命格特殊，妹妹为治哥哥的腿来到碧游村。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/at47ZzKJXxnbIdqqfHmLud2zr3N.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/at47ZzKJXxnbIdqqfHmLud2zr3N.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/2"},{"id":"4095907","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"宝儿姐在村中敲晕部分村民，用三轮车运往山下，途中遇到遁地的异人，不过宝儿姐已能运用身体呼吸，成功将其解决。黑管让宝儿姐将马仙洪引至村中心，以便临时工们合力将其解决。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ybYTIwM9AOWdewbwIAWFPzuQ8Ta.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ybYTIwM9AOWdewbwIAWFPzuQ8Ta.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/3"},{"id":"4095908","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"王震球凭借异能 “爱之马杀鸡” 轻松解决一些对手，后期面对众多敌人时，施展全性妖人夏柳青的戏曲能力，扮成哪吒战斗。老孟则利用生物技术，使上根器体内细菌飙升，令其全身发红发热。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zrIzxzDWojSYOor7ZNfjBMTSjC5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zrIzxzDWojSYOor7ZNfjBMTSjC5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/4"},{"id":"4095909","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"负责操控电磁波的东北临时工，为众人找出敌人精确位置。张楚岚在破坏修身炉时，遭遇马仙洪炼制的 “如花” 和 “松花蛋” 攻击，“松花蛋” 拥有三种异人的异能，其中陈朵的毒险些让张楚岚丧命，好在他凭借爷爷张怀义所教之法，将炁凝聚到肚子里，才得以化险为夷。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qBXefWebagpOC5L1SH4nVFr9t0k.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qBXefWebagpOC5L1SH4nVFr9t0k.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/5"},{"id":"4095910","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"宝儿姐遇到黑管和王震球，马仙洪在赶来救村途中，被众人阻碍。肖自在拖着赵归真的尸块出现，吓到了马仙洪，随后肖哥、宝儿姐、王震球和黑管四人一同攻击马仙洪，将其逼至炉子附近。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-01-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yMewW6Ti3Z6O90TbyhUNG46rWSx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yMewW6Ti3Z6O90TbyhUNG46rWSx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/6"},{"id":"4145643","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"马仙洪凭借炼制的法器顽强抵抗，临时工们一时难以将其拿下。关键时刻，王也赶来助阵，他施展风后奇门，将自己和马仙洪错位到上一个时间里，放慢时间流速，成功拿到马仙洪脖子上的珠子。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-01-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v2FS4wx7g2zSY3JuukoEM3DoVFm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v2FS4wx7g2zSY3JuukoEM3DoVFm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/7"},{"id":"4145644","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"马仙洪最终被临时工们制服，被送到山下交给公司同事。众人意识到陈朵的内心诉求是拥有自主选择的权利，张楚岚让宝儿姐带着耳机找到陈朵，让她重新讲述与廖忠的过往，希望能找到解决问题的办法。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-01-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3HbOaI0YBpRfc0rkSyenhC2Faii.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3HbOaI0YBpRfc0rkSyenhC2Faii.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/8"},{"id":"4145645","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"陈朵渴望能掌控自己的命运，她想将蛊毒压制在体内，脱掉防护衣去逛街。张楚岚虽明白她的想法，但从公司立场和长远考虑，不得不拒绝，他希望通过此举，让众人记住陈朵的遭遇，以便未来能帮助冯宝宝。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/64gqDTCbeVGRauEfzMoKFuXaHzl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/64gqDTCbeVGRauEfzMoKFuXaHzl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/9"},{"id":"4145646","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"张楚岚等人带着陈朵来到热闹的街市，陈朵感受着从未有过的自由。与此同时，公司对碧游村的后续处理工作也在进行，十二上根器中部分人员通过审查，即将成为哪都通员工。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":26,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ldarKgYRqxoctXXE1SjYlizymfK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ldarKgYRqxoctXXE1SjYlizymfK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/10"},{"id":"4145647","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"王也协助临时工们完成了对马仙洪的抓捕，马仙洪被顺利带走。碧游村之战接近尾声，临时工们出色地完成了任务，公司对他们的表现表示认可。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xvbVJP722euOTFH5abIOAaY8KrJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xvbVJP722euOTFH5abIOAaY8KrJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/11"},{"id":"4145648","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"诸葛青接受哪都通公司审讯，陷入碧游村回忆，讲述与马仙洪、王也之间的遗产纠葛。他曾因被王也击败而觊觎风后奇门产生心魔，马仙洪赠送神机百炼后内心纠结，在傅蓉开导下战胜心魔通过审核。冯宝宝接受板凳审查，因心思单纯顺利过关。碧游村事件结束，十二上根器中通过审查者成为哪都通员工，临时工们也顺利过关，但马仙洪在押运途中被其姐姐曲彤救走，曲彤帮他易容并计划重新打造修身炉。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z6yEm5JJB2opU13EcrKXjCzsQOJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z6yEm5JJB2opU13EcrKXjCzsQOJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67063/season/5"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793317348060,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":17933173480